<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Blue Square Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Israel's Blue Square Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blue Square Chain Stores Properties &amp; Investments Ltd, a subsidiary of Blue Square Israel Ltd, reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			   Q1 97	Q1 96</p>
<p>Revenue		  649,642    676,125</p>
<p>Operating profit	 7,435     22,836</p>
<p>Net Profit		 6,071     14,713</p>
<p>Note: The parent company Blue Square Israel released its results in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.395 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
